    {
      "question": "e-4734",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "8ff0bfd0a837ecf45f354c2a626d1ed89bb2d22451159d1852bc53a7af4280c7",
      "new_sha256": "5507651bc0ffc44103664e7eb0f16e71fcdf6a7d360fe41caa229c33b2ca0161",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-4734",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "First, let's find the elementary matrices corresponding to the two given elementary row operations.\n\n- The first operation is $R_2\\leftrightarrow R_3.$ The corresponding elementary matrix can be found by applying this same elementary row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & \u2194{R}_{3} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={E}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The second operation is $R_1:=6R_1.$ The corresponding elementary matrix can be found by applying this same elementary row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=6{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={E}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo apply the first elementary row operation to the matrix $A,$ we multiply by $E_1$ on the left and get $E_1 A\\mathbin{:}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14060012/assets/375f1950c460b1f310fa279f6d7f203f88ff641000715dfaec192f47d785aa93.png)\n\nThen, to apply the second elementary row operation to $E_1 A,$ we multiply by $E_2$ on the left and get $E_2 E_1 A\\mathbin{:}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14060012/assets/6357cc2a2526f38a0f0f7e2e7ef4ee7a1a564adfa70264028ff732f44ba7b763.png)",
